   "notes": "M63 is a chemically defined minimal medium whose only trace metal is FeSO4 and which contains no vitamin mixture (Ralstonia synthesizes its own cofactors). The paper states the entire per-liter recipe inline, so the medium is complete: glucose (C), (NH4)2SO4 (N + S), KH2PO4 (P/K/buffer), MgSO4 (Mg), FeSO4·7H2O (Fe), pH 7, grown aerobically at 28°C. The target's current_components already covered every real ingredient; oxygen corrected from 'facultative' to 'aerobic' (cultures grown shaking/aerobically)."
